/task
1
Prepare a concise homeowner guide to evaluating residential solar in Auckland. Separate general considerations from claims that require current local evidence, identify the evidence still needed, and finish with a pre-publication fact-check checklist. Do not invent current prices, incentives, payback periods, regulations, or performance figures.
